<mxCell id="65" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#999;line-height:1.6;&quot;&gt;TransformerBlock (pre-LN): Self-Attn 使用 RotaryMHA (RoPE + SDPA), FFN = Linear &gt; GELU &gt; Linear&lt;br/&gt;融合层: 关闭 RoPE (A1), 使用 n_heads_fusion=4 (非 n_heads_enc)&lt;br/&gt;解码器: Self-Attn 用 RotaryMHA, Cross-Attn 用 nn.MultiheadAttention (PyTorch 原生)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="970" width="1200" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
